msgid "Drop: `dropna`"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/14-pandas-select-aggregate-join.md:886
msgid "`dropna()` without `subset` drops a row with **any** missing value - often too much. Name the columns that matter."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/14-pandas-select-aggregate-join.md:889
msgid "How complete is each column? `isna().mean()` is the share of missing values - the first table of a data quality report:"
